OL,3,GNEWSAStormont no-confidence motion in
OL,4,Aagriculture minister fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FA no-confidence motion in Agriculture
OL,7,Fand Environment Minister Andrew Muir
OL,8,Fover a controversial cattle cull in
OL,9,FCounty Tyrone has fallen after it
OL,10,Ffailed to secure enough support.
OL,12,FIt received 32 votes in favour after
OL,13,Fbeing proposed by the Democratic
OL,14,FUnionist Party (DUP) with the Ulster
OL,15,FUnionists and Traditional Unionist
OL,16,FVoice (TUV) also backing it.
OL,18,FBut 38 MLAs voted against the proposal,
OL,19,Fwith nationalist parties saying they
OL,20,Fwould not support it.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
