OL,3,GNEWSAStormont no-confidence motion in
OL,4,Aagriculture minister fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlliance leader Naomi Long led a
OL,7,Fwalkout of her MLAs from the chamber at
OL,8,Fthe start of the debate, dismissing the
OL,9,Fmotion as a "pantomime stunt" against
OL,10,Fher minister.
